ugs me.","My grandfather wears glasses.","How many people are in your family?","I love my family.","My brother is older than me.","My sister is younger than me.","My father is a doctor.","My father's name is John.","My mother's name is Mary.","I obey my parents.","My father works at a hospital.","I do chores at home.","My brother's name is Mike.","My sister's name is Emma.","Mike is eighteen years old.","Emma is sixteen years old.","I am twelve years old.","My father is tall and strong.","My mother is kind and patient.","My brother is smart and funny.","My sister is beautiful and helpful.","I am happy and friendly.","My family lives in a big house.","The house has five rooms.","My mother rides a bicycle.","My brother takes the bus to work.","My grandmother has gray hair.","Grandmother is sixty-five years old.","They live with us.","I like living with them.","Grandmother makes delicious food.","Grandfather tells funny stories.","My uncle has a son.","My aunt is my father's sister.","My cousin is the same age as me.","My cousin is my friend.","We play games on the sand.","We eat meals together.","We play together on weekends.","My family has a pet dog.","The dog's name is Max.","Max is brown and white.","I play with Max every day.","My family is very important to me.","I spend time with my family.","We talk and laugh together.","We watch movies together.","We go on trips together.","We swim in the ocean.","It is very fun!","My mother cooks breakfast.","We eat together in the morning.","My brother helps me with homework.","My sister teaches me new things.","My grandfather plays with me.","Do you have a large family?","Or do you have a small family?","Either way, family is important.","I respect my parents.","I listen to my parents.","I help with cooking.","I clean my room.","I wash the dishes.","My mother appreciates my help.","My father praises my effort.","My family is my support.","I am grateful for my family.","Family is forever.","My uncle lives in Seoul.","We vis